# --- Claude Code dev tooling (private; not part of the published product) ---
# Planning docs (specs, initiatives), injected shared rules/hooks/commands
# (symlinks into private ai-config), local settings. The shipped product lives
# at the repo root (skills/, hooks/, bin/, rules/) and in .claude-plugin/.
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md

# Codex effort wrapper / local codex config injected by ai-config (dev-only)
.codex/config.toml.lock.d/

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Node (expanded in Task 1 scaffold)
node_modules/
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store

# Benchmark results (per-machine, not part of the repo)
benchmarks/results-*.jsonl
benchmarks/results-*.md

# `skills` CLI install artifacts. If someone runs `npx skills add` (or our
# installer's curl|bash one-liner) from inside this repo, the skills ecosystem
# drops a canonical copy at .agents/ + a lock file + may symlink skills/<name>.
# Our self-install guard (bin/install.js) refuses to run skills add here, but
# direct `npx skills add` invocations bypass that, so guard the git tree too.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
